# The build context is this directory, and the image wants only the binaries
# `make docker` (or release.yml) assembles here. Everything else is context the
# daemon would copy and the build would ignore.
#
# Every name carries an architecture, because a multi-platform build shares one
# context between its per-architecture builds — see the Dockerfile's header.
*
!regexped-*
!wasm-merge-*
!wasm-tools-*
!wac-*
